 "text": "Itasca County Local Sales and Use Tax | Itasca County, MN\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nDepartments\nResidents\nVisitors\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nDepartments\nAuditor/Treasurer's Office\nItasca County Local Sales and Use Tax\nItasca County Local Sales and Use Tax\nLocal Sales and Use Tax Information\nBeginning April 1, 2023 , Itasca County will collect a 1% sales tax that will be used to fund the new Justice Center Build and Courts Remodel. The State of Minnesota Department of Revenue has provided direction to local businesses impacted by the local tax and the process of collection and payment. The tax applies to businesses located in the boundaries of Itasca County. For more information:\nGeneral Notice for Itasca County (PDF)\nMN Department of Revenue Tax Guide (link)\nProperty Taxes\nElections\nCounty Budget\nElected Officials\nFrequently Asked Questions\nLicensing\nParcel Information System\nView Population Figures\nItasca County Local Sales and Use Tax\nCounty Board\nCommissioner Information\nNotify Me®\nStay informed\nEmployment\nView current openings\nProperty Info\nParcel Information\nContact Us\nStaff Directory\nForms\nForm Center\nMaps\nGet Information\nHelpful Links\nItasca County Fairground Campground\nICTV\nIt's In Minnesota's Nature!\nEdge of the Wilderness\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nQuick Links\nEmergency Notification System\nItasca County Privacy Policy\nSalary Compliance Notice\nPay Your Property Taxes\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nFrequently Asked Questions\nHow do I contact a county department?\nWhere can I find the answers to my frequently asked questions?\n/FAQ.aspx\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Privacy\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nItasca County | 123 NE 4th Street | Grand Rapids, MN 55744 | Phone: 218-327-7363 | Toll Free: 800-422-0312\nReport website problems to helpdesk@co.itasca.mn.us\nLoading\nL